      <ol class="quiz"><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get written confirmation that coverage is accepted. If the claim was denied, talk to a New Mexico attorney before considering appraisal."><span>Has the insurer accepted coverage for at least part of the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Request the full line-item estimate (not just the summary) in writing."><span>Do you have the carrier’s complete, itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get an independent, line-item estimate — a lump-sum bid won’t hold up before a panel."><span>Do you have your own itemized estimate from a contractor or estimator?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Gather every photo you have and note when each was taken. Add new photos of current conditions."><span>Do you have dated photos of the damage taken soon after the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the ‘Appraisal’ paragraph in the conditions section and note any deadlines."><span>Have you read your policy’s appraisal clause?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Locate the ‘Suit Against Us’ clause and calendar the date — the claim calendar builder can help."><span>Do you know your policy’s suit-limitation date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Complete reasonable temporary repairs and keep every receipt."><span>Have temporary repairs been made and receipts saved?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Download or request your current declarations page."><span>Do you have your declarations page?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make sure wet walls, attics and decking have been inspected so the scope is complete."><span>Is all hidden damage opened up and documented?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Collect emails, letters and claim notes in date order."><span>Is your correspondence with the carrier organized by date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Run the numbers in the claim gap net-recovery estimator — a small gap may not justify appraisal costs."><span>Is the gap between estimates more than about 10% or $5,000?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="If a proof of loss was requested, submit it on time."><span>Has a sworn proof of loss been submitted if the carrier asked for one?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-reset>Reset answers</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,300px) 1fr;align-items:start">
      <div>
        <svg class="gauge" viewBox="0 0 200 110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#f3ece0" stroke-width="18"/><path data-o="arc" d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#f2c200" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="251.3" stroke-dashoffset="251.3" style="transition:stroke-dashoffset .5s,stroke .3s"/></svg>
        <div class="gauge-num"><span data-o="score">–</span></div>
        <p class="hint" style="text-align:center">Answered <span data-o="count">0 / 12</span></p>
